# clean-URL handling. There must be NO rule here: a `/ai-guide
# /ai-guide.html 200` rewrite used to sit at this line and created an
# infinite 308 loop, because Pages separately redirects /ai-guide.html
# back to /ai-guide. The page was unreachable from ~Sep 3 to Sep 8 2026.
